      "mergeID": "6aa99f06a8d6c34bd3c4d922",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently the way it is set up it causes every variant of an avatar that is from a bundle to be listed individually and each listing will only show the pictures attached to that specific variant of the avatar.\n\nThis causes mass bloat of the same avatar throughout the store, and would mean we would need to have the same pictures on every avatar variant if any of them contain important information such as features etc. \n\nIt would be more organized to have avatar bundles be shown as one listing only, and those listings show all images from every avatar variant. It would reduce bloat of the same avatar being shown repeatedly and condense all the pictures down, so users do not need to click through every version of the avatar to view all the pictures.\n\nIt could optionally be opt in, as some bundles may have multiple different avatars vs different variants of the same avatar, this would atleast stop the bloat of multiple versions of the same avatar being shown on the store page.\n\nAlternatively if its wanted to keep it so every variant shows up in search results, have it so when you select it it takes you to the bundle view immediately and show all pictures like stated above.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Bundles should have 1 result in the search and show all pictures in the bundle",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "682e559b935c2fedd4176e62",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 3
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is the biggest feedback for me as well as it's leading my product to be misrepresented in Vrchat's Marketplace.\n\nI have set up my Avatar as a Bundle of 3 variations but they are all listed as individuals that costs 2400 V-credits with no indication (that I can tell) that it's a bundle.\n\nI want it to make it clear for the buyer that it's part of a package and that they will get multiple variations. The Deal they are shown is 1/3rd of what I am selling.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
